  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "pi_c",
      "defType": "meta/comment",
      "position": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": -264
      },
      "params": {
        "text": "Palette from an image\n\nThe Palette node's `image` mode finds the dominant colours of a picture (k-means in the OKLab colour space, so the clusters are the colours your eye groups), `stopCount` of them, sorted by `sort` — lightness, frequency or hue. The same picture always gives the same palette.\n\nHere a photo's palette colours a Mondrian (Cells' subdivide mode) beside it. Load another picture with the URL, or wire a Camera.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200
      },
      "portValues": {
        "text": "Palette from an image\n\nThe Palette node's `image` mode finds the dominant colours of a picture (k-means in the OKLab colour space, so the clusters are the colours your eye groups), `stopCount` of them, sorted by `sort` — lightness, frequency or hue. The same picture always gives the same palette.\n\nHere a photo's palette colours a Mondrian (Cells' subdivide mode) beside it. Load another picture with the URL, or wire a Camera.",
        "width": 520,
        "height": 200
      }
    },
